state.description:
`running`; `decided` (the sequential test stopped: see `decision` and `winner`);
`undecided` (n_max seeds ran without a decision); `budget` (the compute budget was
spent before a decision; on your machine: the next pair would pass `max_usd`);
`killed` (stopped at the dollar cap);
`failed` (the command failed or printed no result, see `detail`); `lost` (stopped
reporting well past its deadline); `refused`.
